  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## IT Ticket: Like Button Not Working\r\n\r\nA user reported that the Like button is not working correctly.\r\n\r\n### Expected Behavior:\r\n- Clicking the button should switch between \"Like\" and \"Liked\"\r\n- The heart icon should update to match the current state\r\n- The like count should increase when liked and return when unliked\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Run the app and test the Like button.\r\n2. Investigate the code.\r\n3. Fix the issues.\r\n\r\nUse AI (if needed) to explain the code before making changes.:\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "tutor",
    "predict_settings": {
